# Per-Dockerfile ignore file (BuildKit uses it for `-f apps/web/Dockerfile`).
# Paths are relative to the build context, which is the repo root.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.worktrees
.loop-evidence
.git
legacy
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
